Lead the development of the ERP Roadmap and ensure its integration with the overall Technology Strategy and Digital Technology Journey Map;
Assist with reviewing and establishing an ERP sourcing model required to transition and optimise the South32 team and capabilities;
Establish, govern and optimise the ERP practices and processes in alignment with the service management suppliers, broader Platform teams and other Technology Managers;
Ensure interactions for both producers of technology services and the consumers of technology are clearly articulated and shared across Technology and the broader South32 organisation;
