Review and approve financial system master data changes for African entities;
Build and continually improve the ERP team, ensuring the right level of capabilities, knowledge and skills to support the ERP and Technology strategies as well as the requirements of the operations and supporting functions within South32;
Drive a culture of continuous improvement to ensure ongoing enhancement and optimisation of ERP capabilities and technical skill.
